Source: repocompare
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Vitex Software <packaging@vitexsoftware.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), dh-python, python3-all, python3-setuptools
Standards-Version: 4.6.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: repocompare
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${python3:Depends}
Description: Compare Debian package metadata between two APT repositories
 A small CLI tool to compare package names and versions between two APT
 repositories. Useful for auditing and repo sync verification.

Package: multiflexi-repocompare
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, repocompare, multiflexi-cli
Description: Multiflexi application manifest for repocompare
 Provides a Multiflexi application JSON manifest that registers `repocompare`
 with the Multiflexi runner. Installs metadata into
 /usr/lib/multiflexi-repocompare/multiflexi/.